<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 24px;">
    <div style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px;">
      <h2 style="color: #1a1a1a;">Reset your password</h2>
      <p>Hi {{firstName}},</p>
      <p>Use the code below to reset your Cowrywise password. It expires in 10 minutes.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 8px; text-align: center; background: #f0f0f0; padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px;">{{otp}}</p>
      <p>If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email — your password will remain unchanged.</p>
      <p style="color: #888; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 32px;">&copy; {{currentYear}} Cowrywise</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>